  "description": "Broken Yolk Cafe is an American breakfast chain, known for its scratch-made ingredients, generous portion sizes, family atmosphere, and creative culinary concoctions. The brand got its start as a neighborhood breakfast restaurant in San Diego’s Pacific Beach area in 1979. It has since grown to over 40 locally-owned locations across five states, all serving breakfast classics like buttermilk pancakes, chicken and waffles, and eggs benedict. As well as more unique creations, like the Hawaiian street bread “Tiki Toast”, the Country Skillet, Cinna-Cakes, and a rich assortment of Mexican-inspired dishes.",
